{"id":"n36953-3-7","stage":5,"title":"구기다 · 皱","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36953-3-7-1","ko":"무슨 일인데 표정을 그렇게 구기고 있어?","zh":"怎么了，表情这么阴沉的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일인데","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"표정을","meaning":"表情，脸色","explanation":"표정：表情，脸色；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"표정","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72390","senseId":"1","lemma":"표정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구기고","meaning":"皱","explanation":"구기다：皱；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"구기다","audio":"/audio/093fdae55f590636e32f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36953","senseId":"3","lemma":"구기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"fb140081bcc182e5","term":"표정","zh":"表情，脸色","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3","entryId":"72390","definition":"心中的情感或想法等表露在脸上；或指那样的模样。","pronunciation":["표정"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"093fdae55f590636","term":"구기다","zh":"皱","audio":"/audio/093fdae55f590636e32f.mp3","entryId":"36953","definition":"(粗俗)眉头或脸上起很难看的褶纹。","pronunciation":["구기다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b2e2cffd03016449a095.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n36953-3-7-2","ko":"갑자기 야근을 하라니 짜증이 나잖아.","zh":"突然要加班，我当然会生气啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"야근을","meaning":"加班","explanation":"야근：加班；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"야근","audio":"/audio/e8aeeb6fc5aa42e226b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90303","senseId":"1","lemma":"야근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하라니","meaning":"表示应当。","explanation":"하다：表示应当。；라니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짜증이","meaning":"心烦，厌烦，闹心","explanation":"짜증：心烦，厌烦，闹心；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"짜증","audio":"/audio/78dd3ebff92b1941ec4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71579","senseId":"1","lemma":"짜증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나잖아.","meaning":"感到烦躁（짜증이/가 나다）","explanation":"나다：感到烦躁（짜증이/가 나다）；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"12","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"e8aeeb6fc5aa42e2","term":"야근","zh":"加班","audio":"/audio/e8aeeb6fc5aa42e226b8.mp3","entryId":"90303","definition":"过了下班时间后工作到很晚。","pronunciation":["야ː근"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示应当。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示应当。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"78dd3ebff92b1941","term":"짜증","zh":"心烦，厌烦，闹心","audio":"/audio/78dd3ebff92b1941ec4a.mp3","entryId":"71579","definition":"由于不满意而发火或把厌恶之情表露于外；或指那样的性格。","pronunciation":["짜증"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"感到烦躁（짜증이/가 나다）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"感到烦躁（짜증이/가 나다）","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0c374a70ea33772459da.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.169,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=36953","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":151,"sequenceScore":2.9957,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["怎么了，表情这么阴沉的？","突然要加班，我当然会生气啊。","房间太冷了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["怎么了，表情这么阴沉的？","突然要加班，我当然会生气啊。","房间太冷了。"],"answer":1}]}
